{"id":"faq_maple_today","library_id":"KB08","knowledge_type":"faq_rule","name":"现在去能看到红叶吗？","content":"先询问计划日期；调用KB04查询当年枫情和近期实景。没有实时信息时，只能给季节规律，并明确不能保证。","source_type":"curated_decision_rule","source_name":"用户提供的栖霞山知识材料","captured_at":"2026-10-27","valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"verification_status":"approved_internal_rule","confidence":"high","freshness":"static","aliases":[],"audience":["全部游客"],"related_pois":[],"warnings":[],"tags":["FAQ"],"updated_at":"2026-10-27","question":"现在去能看到红叶吗？","answer_rule":"先询问计划日期；调用KB04查询当年枫情和近期实景。没有实时信息时，只能给季节规律，并明确不能保证。","required_libraries":["KB04","KB07"]}
{"id":"faq_departure_time","library_id":"KB08","knowledge_type":"faq_rule","name":"周末几点出发比较合适？","content":"先确认日期、交通方式和入口；调用KB04查交通与活动，再用KB07补充高峰风险。不要把“9点前”固定成全年规则。","source_type":"curated_decision_rule","source_name":"用户提供的栖霞山知识材料","captured_at":"2026-10-27","valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"verification_status":"approved_internal_rule","confidence":"high","freshness":"static","aliases":[],"audience":["全部游客"],"related_pois":[],"warnings":[],"tags":["FAQ"],"updated_at":"2026-10-27","question":"周末几点出发比较合适？","answer_rule":"先确认日期、交通方式和入口；调用KB04查交通与活动，再用KB07补充高峰风险。不要把“9点前”固定成全年规则。","required_libraries":["KB04","KB07"]}
{"id":"faq_senior_route","library_id":"KB08","knowledge_type":"faq_rule","name":"带老人怎么走？","content":"先问游览时长、步行能力和台阶接受度；优先KB05已核验路段，完整路线不足时从KB06提供候选并标注未实测；同时调用KB03补卫生间。","source_type":"curated_decision_rule","source_name":"用户提供的栖霞山知识材料","captured_at":"2026-10-27","valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"verification_status":"approved_internal_rule","confidence":"high","freshness":"static","aliases":[],"audience":["全部游客"],"related_pois":[],"warnings":[],"tags":["FAQ"],"updated_at":"2026-10-27","question":"带老人怎么走？","answer_rule":"先问游览时长、步行能力和台阶接受度；优先KB05已核验路段，完整路线不足时从KB06提供候选并标注未实测；同时调用KB03补卫生间。","required_libraries":["KB03","KB05","KB06","KB07"]}
{"id":"faq_restroom","library_id":"KB08","knowledge_type":"faq_rule","name":"最近的卫生间在哪里？","content":"必须获取用户当前所在POI或入口，再调用KB03。没有坐标时提供附近景点和官方小程序导航，不虚构距离。","source_type":"curated_decision_rule","source_name":"用户提供的栖霞山知识材料","captured_at":"2026-10-27","valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"verification_status":"approved_internal_rule","confidence":"high","freshness":"static","aliases":[],"audience":["全部游客"],"related_pois":[],"warnings":[],"tags":["FAQ"],"updated_at":"2026-10-27","question":"最近的卫生间在哪里？","answer_rule":"必须获取用户当前所在POI或入口，再调用KB03。没有坐标时提供附近景点和官方小程序导航，不虚构距离。","required_libraries":["KB03"]}
{"id":"faq_parking","library_id":"KB08","knowledge_type":"faq_rule","name":"可以停在哪里？","content":"调用KB03列出官方小程序停车场；实时空位、收费和管制转查KB04或官方渠道。P1名称明确为大客车停车场，不默认推荐给小汽车。","source_type":"curated_decision_rule","source_name":"用户提供的栖霞山知识材料","captured_at":"2026-10-27","valid_from":null,"valid_until":null,"verification_status":"approved_internal_rule","confidence":"high","freshness":"static","aliases":[],"audience":["全部游客"],"related_pois":[],"warnings":[],"tags":["FAQ"],"updated_at":"2026-10-27","question":"可以停在哪里？","answer_rule":"调用KB03列出官方小程序停车场；实时空位、收费和管制转查KB04或官方渠道。P1名称明确为大客车停车场，不默认推荐给小汽车。","required_libraries":["KB03","KB04"]}
